WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:35.451
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.710
Hello.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.600
Hello.

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:26.660
[Money]

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.440
[Honey]

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:33.640
Haejun, can I borrow your notebook?

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:34.810
Sure.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:35.980
Let me find it.

00:03:50.579 --> 00:03:52.260
I remember you like apples.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.780
I brought this from home.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:54.620
Have it.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:24.850
Haejun, I'm leaving.

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:51.920
Who gave you permission
to accept gifts from others?

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.159
Who gave you

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:56.820
permission to

00:04:57.850 --> 00:04:59.310
accept gifts from others?

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:00.630
Who gave you

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:02.480
permission to

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:03.970
accept gifts from others?

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.720
Have you forgotten my rules?

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.850
Except me,

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.730
keep your distance from everyone else.

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.000
You can't leave me.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:06:59.500
Come here.

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:05.420
Sorry.

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:08.400
Class is almost over.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.700
Let go of me!

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:32.810
Why are you doing this to me?

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:35.760
Because you're mine.

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:38.820
I don't like this.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.510
So what?

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:43.650
You can't leave me.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:48.040
Behave.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:49.670
Understand?

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.470
Let go of me!

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:06.790
It'll be fine.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.750
Please behave,

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:09.710
okay?